# Layers (CR 613.1e before 613.4c): Heraldic Banner choosing green pumps creatures that are green when the power layer is
# applied. Painter's Servant (choosing green) makes every permanent green in addition to its other colors, so Bot1's
# colorless Ornithopter (0/2) becomes 1/2, its black Misshapen Fiend 2/1, and the Servant itself (1/3) 2/3. Bot2's green-by-the-Servant
# Elvish Mystic is not under Bot1's control, so it stays 1/1.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Heraldic Banner
Ornithopter
Misshapen Fiend
Painter's Servant
Swamp
10 Swamp

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
10 Swamp

